# Commands run by the launchd job com.redwood.demo (see com.redwood.demo.plist).
# What PosterBoard leaves on the data volume (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.snaps, gpu=1). The wash of wallpaper
# that the switcher puts over a card behind the front one -- PaperBoardUI's "fake wallpaper", the
# layer whose animation is AlignFakeWallpaperToLayer -- comes out as one flat magenta here, and
# PaperBoardUI takes such a picture from a file (PBUIURLBackedSnapshotSource). These listings say
# which files those are: first every directory, then every file worth a picture. find comes from
# the package manager's prefix, because the job runner starts a program without a shell.
/redwood/bin/sound_test springboard
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 25 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 70
/var/jb/usr/bin/find /var/mobile -maxdepth 4 -type d -ls
/var/jb/usr/bin/find /var/mobile -type f -size +60k -ls
